{"hw":"βιωτός","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">βιωτός</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">βι-ωτός</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">όν</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be lived, worth living</b>, mostly with neg., <span class=\"gk\">ἔμοιγ' ὁ μέλλων βίος οὐ β.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">OC</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1692</span> </span> (lyr.), cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pl.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">197</span> </span> (dub.), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">38a</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">οὐ βιωτὸν οὐδ' ἀνασχετόν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Antiph.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">190</span> </span>. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">10</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">οὐκ ἦν μοι β. του&lt;*το ποιήσαντι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">21.120</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἆρ' οὖν β. ἡμῖν ἐστιν μετὰ μοχθηροῦ σώματος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cri.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">47e</span> </span>.</div></div>"}